{39}{On secun' thought, maybe me shouldn't do diis. It my health.}{}{-4}{}{30}{}
{40}{[He half-laughs] The pay? [He searches through his desk and pockets] I have exactly 37 gold left to my name. Everything else is in the bank, or with my sons in Norleigh. Oh, and everyone calls me Mr. Yoki. Don't know why. They just do.}{[He half-laughs] The pay? [He searches through his desk and pockets] I have exactly 37 gold left to my name. Everything else is in the bank, or with my sons in Norleigh. Oh, and everyone calls me Mr. Yoki. Don't know why. They just do.}{}{}{}{gf 2825 1}
