{47}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{48}{Sir! Please, I'm begging you. You believe you can free us from this threat, and I'm offering all I have left to give. I realize it's an insultingly low sum, but I never imagined an adventurer would just happen by and that's why all our valuables went with my sons. [His pleading eyes show his desperation]}{Madam! Please, I'm begging you. You believe you can free us from this threat, and I'm offering all I have left to give. I realize it's an insultingly low sum, but I never imagined an adventurer would just happen by and that's why all our valuables went with my sons. [His pleading eyes show his desperation]}{}{}{}{}
{49}{Let me think about it. [You weigh you chances] Let me go and properly assess the situation. I will inform you of my decision.}{}{5}{}{56}{}
{50}{Let me tink sum 'baout it. [You weigh your chances] Let me aks aroun' and git to know job little better, Den me say if yes or no.}{}{-4}{}{56}{}
{51}{Well, desperate times call for desperate measures, and this is a desperate situation. I accept your terms Mr. Yoki.}{}{}{}{76}{}
{52}{37 gold... Me neva work so cheap but take whut I can git. You have deal, Mr. Yoki. }{}{}{}{76}{}
