{83}{[He smiles] I'm a trusting sort, but I don't know young Lasou that well. He'll take home a  promissory note for the woodcutter in Brandybuck. I shall simply pay for the repairs he does to the Vlafa's home and then hope Byuammen repays me in a timely manner.}{[He smiles] I'm a trusting sort, but I don't know young Lasou that well. He'll take home a  promissory note for the woodcutter in Brandybuck. I shall simply pay for the repairs he does to the Vlafa's home and then hope Byuammen repays me in a timely manner.}{}{}{}{}
{84}{Thank you for clearing that matter up. May I ask another question?}{}{5}{}{62}{}
{85}{[He smiles] Do you know what a promissory note is? It works like this - I will give a note to Lasou to give to the woodcutter in Brandybuck. The woodcutter fixes the house that Lasou lives in, and then he sends a message to me letting me know how much I owe him. I will pay the bill and Lasou's father will give me the same amount of money.}{[He smiles] Do you know what a promissory note is? It works like this - I will give a note to Lasou to give to the woodcutter in Brandybuck. The woodcutter fixes the house that Lasou lives in, and then he sends a message to me letting me know how much I owe him. I will pay the bill and Lasou's father will give me the same amount of money.}{}{}{}{}
{86}{Ah! Me see now. Dis is gud! If La-soo try to take munee home, he might get robbed. Dis way ever'one get dere money but da thiefs get nuttin'! }{}{-4}{}{87}{}
{87}{[He nods with raised eyebrows] I hadn't thought of it that way, but Yes! That's exactly how it works.}{[He nods with raised eyebrows] I hadn't thought of it that way, but Yes! That's exactly how it works.}{}{}{}{}
{88}{Heh, me gettin' smarter. Me aks anutter qus-shion?}{}{4}{}{62}{}
{89}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{90}{Yes, of course. Speak with my wife about a place to spend the night.  I think I hear her in the kitchen. If there's any trouble, I'll send someone around to wake you.}{Yes, of course. Speak with my wife about a place to spend the night.  I think I hear her in the kitchen. If there's any trouble, I'll send someone around to wake you.}{}{}{}{}
