{96}{Why, yes he did. He's down at the Little Creek Bridge tending the fires right now. I tell you, that boy's been gods-send. He got here a couple days after Lankara, Tom, and Dooley were killed, and he's been doing the work of two men ever since.  }{Why, yes he did. He's down at the Little Creek Bridge tending the fires right now. I tell you, that boy's been gods-send. He got here a couple days after Lankara, Tom, and Dooley were killed, and he's been doing the work of two men ever since.  }{}{}{}{}
