{216}{[He is pleasantly surprised] Actually, and I hate to even say anything considering the service you've just provided, there are two things. The favor will depend upon which way you'll be travelling from here. Are you planning to return to Norleigh or continue inland?}{[He is pleasantly surprised] Actually, and I hate to even say anything considering the service you've just provided, there are two things. The favor will depend upon which way you'll be travelling from here. Are you planning to return to Norleigh or continue inland?}{}{}{}{}
