{230}{[He grins] I believe I can understand your reason. When you return to Norleigh, if you happen to encounter my sons, give them the good news and - I dread this part - tell them to bring anyone they've hired? I'll find some use for those men.}{[He grins] I believe I can understand your reason. When you return to Norleigh, if you happen to encounter my sons, give them the good news and - I dread this part - tell them to bring anyone they've hired? I'll find some use for those men.}{}{}{}{qu 1168 2}
